{"url": "https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/01-10-2024-gartner-says-worldwide-pc-shipments-increased-zero-point-three-percent-in-fourth-quarter-of-2023-but-declined-fourteen-point-eight-percent-for-the-year", "summary": "Gartner官方2023全年报告：2020—2021疫情期间PC需求异常增长，之后2022和2023连续双位数下降；2022全球284.052百万、2023为241.891百万，2023下降14.8%；2023Q4终止八季连续下降。", "capture_type": "web_tool_visible_summary_snapshot", "download_error": "HTTPError"}